    "group": "Changehost of Deceit",
    "summary": "Your **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS** units get the **Daemonic Illusions (Aura)** ability:\n\n**Aura (6\")**: against ranged attacks, models in your **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** units in range that are **visible** to this unit get a 4+ invulnerable save.\n\nYour **THOUSAND SONS** units get the **Mortal Sorcery (Aura)** ability:\n\n**Aura (6\")**: your **SCINTILLATING LEGIONS PSYKER** units in range that are **visible** to this unit get [Cabal of Sorcerers](vsdata:ability/thousand-sons.cabal-of-sorcerers).",
